---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — 51NAV"
  description="The terms that govern your use of 51NAV and its directory of links and resources."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="guide-content mt-4">
      <p><em>Last updated: 2026-09-24</em></p>
      <h2>Acceptance of terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing 51NAV you agree to these terms. 51NAV is provided "as is" without warranties of
        any kind.
      </p>
      <h2>Use of the directory</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You may use 51NAV for personal, non-commercial discovery of websites and tools.</li>
        <li>We do not guarantee the availability, accuracy, or safety of external sites we link to.</li>
        <li>All trademarks, logos and brand names belong to their respective owners.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>External content</h2>
      <p>
        Clicking a link leaves 51NAV and takes you to a third-party site. We are not affiliated with,
        and not responsible for, the content, practices or policies of those sites.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use constitutes acceptance of the changes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
